      "text": "epic-e2e-relay-state-isolation: per-spec docker compose restart relay auto-fixture to wipe stale kind-30443 KeyPackages between spec files.",
      "reason": "Relitigates the 2026-05-01 reversal in commit 7b31ba1. The per-spec _relayReset fixture was tried, broke 'npx playwright test' for callers without the relay container up, and masked test-design bugs behind sweeping cleanups. The standing principle (feedback_e2e_relay_independence.md) is that e2e tests must pass against any relay state via within-test isolation: pinClientSlot, rotated bunker keys, Date.now() group names, clearAppState — not fixture-level resets. If a test seems to need a clean relay, the test has a bug."
    }
